<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar ends flat at 479.50/480.50/dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar ends flat at 479.50/480.50/dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed flat in quiet trade as the Central Bank met the majority of the day's corporate demand for dollars, traders said.</p>
<p>The session contrasted with last week, when the Bank let the exchange rate slip steadily and generally stayed away from the market.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a quiet day, the Central Bank covered the market and seemed happy with bolivar at 480,&quot; said one trader at a large bank.</p>
<p>((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
